        <mxCell id="c245" value="&lt;b&gt;Catatan Uji Banding, Autentikasi, &amp;amp; Integritas Data (3NF):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• P1–P4 (SAMPLE) &amp;amp; K1–K4 (CONTROL) terikat di trees untuk growth_records.&lt;br&gt;• users memisahkan hak akses Mitra (E3) vs Tim Pengamat (E4).&lt;br&gt;• UQ1 mencegah duplikasi baris saat unggah ulang buffer MicroSD." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.0;dashed=1;fontColor=#222222;fontSize=8.6;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="42" y="646" width="420" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
